   1576  fa26
   1577  fa26							; ClearPFColumn — A = left-half col 0..19; LineCount ($84) = first row;
   1578  fa26							;   CollisionEndY = last row (inclusive). AND-clear that col's
   1579  fa26							;   PF bit in those rows only. Clobbers A/X/Y/Temp ($AD) — NO CollisionX
   1580  fa26							;   (plan 5.1: BombMarkWalls keeps its broken-wall count there across the
   1581  fa26							;   call). Same-bank rts tail: BombMarkWalls jsrs this directly; the old
   1582  fa26							;   CallPad_ClearPFColumn path died with ApplyBombWalls (dead pad kept).
   1583  fa26				   ClearPFColumn
   1584  fa26		       a8		      tay		; Y = col
   1585  fa27		       b9 57 fa 	      lda	BombClearMask,Y
